content.text:
I have enough verified data. 3758.88 lb = ~1705 kg. Cargo: 332 L seats up, 1114 L seats down (consistent across sources). North America: not rated for towing (Hyundai USA/Canada do not publish a tow rating for Kona Electric).

```json
