      "name": "Hyundai Canada Kona Electric specs",
      "accessed": "2026-04-24"
    },
    "notes": "Max cargo behind front seats per Hyundai NA. EU figure 1114 L (to window line)."
  },
  "tow_rating_kg": {
    "value": 0,
    "confidence": "High",
    "notes": "Hyundai Canada/USA do not publish a tow rating; not recommended/rated for towing in North America. EU braked rating ~750 kg is region-specific."
  },
  "weight_kg": {
    "value": 1705,
    "confidence": "High",
    "source": {
      "url": "https://www.edmunds.com/hyundai/kona-electric/2025/st-402040674/features-specs/",
      "name": "Edmunds 2025 Kona Electric SEL specs",
      "accessed": "2026-04-24"
    },
    "notes": "3759 lb = 1705 kg curb weight, Long Range SEL/Limited RWD."
  }
}
```

Note: cargo figures are the trickiest field. EU spec sheets cite 332/1114 L (below tonneau / to window). Hyundai NA brochures cite 25.5/64.0 cu ft = ~723/1814 L (to roof). Used the NA convention to match Canadian-market sourcing. If your seed convention is below-tonneau / to-window, swap to 332/1114.
